<div style="max-width: 34rem; margin: var(--s-6) auto;">
  <p class="eyebrow">Admin</p>
  <h1>Delete this project?</h1>

  <div class="panel" style="margin-top: var(--s-4);">
    <p style="margin:0;"><strong><%= project.title %></strong></p>
    <p class="mono" style="font-size:.7rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 4px 0 0;">/work/<%= project.slug %></p>
  </div>

  <p style="margin-top: var(--s-4);">
    This removes the project, its disciplines, metrics, links, and search entries.
    It cannot be undone from here.
  </p>
  <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size:.92rem;">
    The change is recorded in the audit log with a full snapshot, so the content can be
    recovered by hand if this was a mistake.
  </p>

  <div style="display:flex; gap: var(--s-2); margin-top: var(--s-5);">
    <form method="post" action="/admin/projects/<%= project.id %>/delete">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
      <button class="btn btn-danger" type="submit">Delete Permanently</button>
    </form>
    <a class="btn btn-quiet" href="/admin/projects">Keep It</a>
  </div>
</div>
